{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1000_p", "source_sha256": "858228efac5be424459f3d17631ddafd5d3e76268deb0af0763fe4c5c56d27c3", "ja": "伊織、ブログ見たぞ。いい内容じゃないか！\nファンの間でも、評判になってるよ。", "zh": "伊织，我看了你的博客。内容不错嘛！\n在粉丝之间也很受好评哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "185113b74ac8e78817c74ee158c26583086184e99ba4beb9807c63d0e3e4e103", "ja": "あら、そうなの？　わりと当たり前のことを\n書いただけだと思うけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，是吗？我还以为只是写了些\n挺理所当然的事情呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1002_p", "source_sha256": "646d6051bbd0d0b9f09cd37ce635789465bb15e785ecd490e0f3cf4938a3953a", "ja": "コメントもぐんぐん伸びてるんだ。もしかしたら、\nブログで新しいファンも獲得できるかもな！", "zh": "评论也在不断增加。说不定博客也能吸引到新粉丝呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "c80856294f4ae32b3e09846a174c881b0858f50a3250c3e7c25d66c01bb0d65e", "ja": "それも当たり前じゃない。あんた、どうして私が\nわざわざブログを書いてると思ってるのよ。", "zh": "那也是理所当然的吧。你以为我为什么要特意写博客啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "70d588bc9fd31e08d5fa9b47ae2902ba9fdb1f0fb98d3a3ac542f8ba25a22754", "ja": "SNSでたっぷりバズらせて、世界に私を知らしめる\nために決まってるでしょ？", "zh": "当然是为了在社交平台上狠狠引爆话题，\n好让全世界都知道本小姐的存在呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1005_p", "source_sha256": "84753a59a8fd48a435222af0281c490b568739d55e96e19e9a8a12eb1ff6e592", "ja": "そ、そうだよな。なんか台無しだけど、その通りだ。\nで、狙い通りの成果が出そうで、よかったなと……。", "zh": "对、对啊。虽然感觉有点扫兴，但确实是这样。\n而且，看起来也能取得预想中的成果，我就觉得挺好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "deb5cef8ae78517522505557ca01345e1ce560c97138e3d20802d4ab6f8c260b", "ja": "そうね。で、あんたはコメントが増えたぐらいで\nはしゃいで、わざわざ言いに来たわけ？", "zh": "是啊。你该不会只是因为评论增加了点，就兴奋成这样，还特意跑来告诉我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1007_p", "source_sha256": "913ecc49b99324b8b09f407854e5a84676fa6d945fb6f9b55b18fefe93a7dbe2", "ja": "ええと、はい。そんな感じです。", "zh": "呃，对，差不多就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_059_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_059_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "371bf3939cb3d52cc0bf5ec108696554a3c4f91facb409de43a74752c68f5f99", "ja": "はぁ。そんなヒマがあるなら、仕事のひとつでも\nとって来なさいよね。それか……そうね、せめて……。", "zh": "唉，要是你有那么多闲工夫，就去接一份工作回来吧。或者……这么说吧，至少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
